      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "来ます――黒騎士の気配がします",
      "source_en": "Here it comes - I sense the presence of the Black Knight.",
      "text": "Er kommt. Ich spüre den Schwarzen Ritter."
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "1",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "死に損なったか、セシリー――",
      "source_en": "Did you fail to die, Cecily...",
      "text": "Du bist also dem Tod entkommen, Cecily …"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "2",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "――行くぞ！",
      "source_en": "Let's go!",
      "text": "Los jetzt!"
